  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Moogs_Temples_Reimagined/MP_MoogsTemplesReimagined_header.webp\" alt=\"横幅\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fD1D8LKA5N\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://ko-fi.com/img/githubbutton_sm.svg\" alt=\"Ko-fi\"></a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fS5nffJbuvA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/869218732650688543?color=008080&amp;label=DISCORD&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/finndog_123/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-projects-008080?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge\" alt=\"CurseForge项目\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fFinnDog_123\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-projects-008080?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth项目\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpreviews.moogsmods.com%252ftemples-reimagined%252f1.21.1%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://pub-24a4e0e7ea8544a5b6f73c3a23512589.r2.dev/images/c110cc09347a4f9f9de6c974f2fa35d8.png\" alt=\"查看结构\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Moogs_Temples_Reimagined/MP_MoogsTemplesReimagined_overview.webp\" alt=\"概览\"></p><p>此模组适用于Forge、Fabric和NeoForge！请务必查看<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moogs-structure-lib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Moogs结构库</a>支持的版本。</p><h3>关于</h3><p>Moog的寺庙重制版将原版寺庙结构替换为更大、更完善的版本。新增了沙漠、丛林、海洋、恶地和下界寺庙，以及一个自定义的要塞。基于MoogsStructureLib构建。</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpreviews.moogsmods.com%252ftemples-reimagined%252f1.21.1%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://pub-24a4e0e7ea8544a5b6f73c3a23512589.r2.dev/images/f8fe835413394a76b10a678afefea30f.png\" alt=\"以3D方式浏览所有结构\"></a></p><h3>前置要求</h3><p><strong>MoogsStructureLib</strong> - 此模组需要<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moogs-structure-lib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MoogsStructureLib</a>才能运行。请确保将其与此模组一同安装。</p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Moogs_Temples_Reimagined/MP_MoogsTemplesReimagined_features.webp\" alt=\"功能与展示\"></p><h3>结构列表</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>沙漠寺庙</strong></li>\n<li><strong>丛林寺庙</strong></li>\n<li><strong>海洋寺庙</strong></li>\n<li><strong>恶地寺庙</strong></li>\n<li><strong>下界寺庙</strong></li>\n<li><strong>要塞</strong></li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://pub-24a4e0e7ea8544a5b6f73c3a23512589.r2.dev/images/7edc1556b8934fe38ccc3179e2365c3c.png\" alt=\"拼贴图\"></p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Moogs_Temples_Reimagined/MP_MoogsTemplesReimagined_discord.webp\" alt=\"Discord\"></p><p>获取回复最快的方式是加入我们的<a href=\"https://discord.gg/S5nffJbuvA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord服务器</a>。</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fmoogsmods%253fr%253dcfmtr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Moogs_Temples_Reimagined/MP_MoogsTemplesReimagined_promo.webp\" alt=\"BH赞助商\"></a></p>",
